      "audioSha256": "3742f027c49c488d1ed92ec52f14bf3826728a903a6b4fe371c405a419bc9698",
      "recognized": "真是太惨烈了。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0002-u020",
      "targetTextSha256": "ba5b0be512aeffe49c59830779f889e6d732f1ab51d902bd547ec6f249ef2568",
      "audioSha256": "99438b92dd79ef2e4e7663a9ed22530039579ed2585c58d96173d9eb0265cd4e",
      "recognized": "一支两亿人的大军兴起，征服了地上三分之一的人。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0002-u021",
      "targetTextSha256": "be5c9cc7551598696f002fa528f1650d1c333b602c0e8952249d883b39ea9685",
      "audioSha256": "1425f96a7a8f83233e62cb6067bb103c21e6006a29c980e3b203dd6dac3ee116",
      "recognized": "死亡人数多得惊人。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0002-u022",
      "targetTextSha256": "eb32898cdbe9977fcbc43f4f19dad08992fa4bd35dbc6c57b9dd3cbfb9b50b76",
      "audioSha256": "e11ce519463707711b7bcccc22b743bad46d4a1b69f5a3ec72d4086dc0ebc9ca",
      "recognized": "你算一下，就会发现地上有二十七亿人丧生。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0002-u023",
      "targetTextSha256": "c5bf017a4c1af6bd0870abc287df523a65354e091bee232b894e41b5efefebb1",
      "audioSha256": "bc49c034ba3f3d36cdd3cfb6b9d724ac312fea593fd87577a39295b79641ee7c",
      "recognized": "这太惨烈了。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0002-u024",
      "targetTextSha256": "d90533330f62aee4b96facd3382f4ac4259324253d8ed0446b502dcce444e6f7",
      "audioSha256": "3b3af6466bc11bc5a3466812b8418922ae819c7c82f529300de90ce3b55baa8c",
      "recognized": "这实在太猛烈了。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0002-u025",
      "targetTextSha256": "f6ed1719ade39e630bc93c0a3073ab92027ccd7c1ac97bc3d3bac9646111bcb4",
      "audioSha256": "bfdeb3659e99a15a263718bace494a6e99c40ffff7d0428ec0b1b94e5e357ad1",
      "recognized": "好，那么我们该怎么看待这些号呢？",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0002-u026",
      "targetTextSha256": "cc7b4c805d114220c5fa7c33d07615258ac47802a09244e4ec32262eafc03a69",
      "audioSha256": "06055f54b3412711367d182f621a5b303062c31644467627b175348c9e929fe3",
      "recognized": "我们该怎样理解这些号呢？",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0002-u027",
      "targetTextSha256": "80701455f56d6fb006e93cf98bb6ade55eba7084cb7f09bf36894f7b1f280be9",
      "audioSha256": "b0331ba25627bedad42bd502b0266e11c7249218727b27dab45f88d24e5a80c0",
      "recognized": "现在有一点我们需要特别留意：在过去两千年的教会历史中。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0002-u028",
      "targetTextSha256": "fd79d9208dc1e2118d6dd4b2ef85cdbd99a80bdc8857bc9cdb76fac242974ae2",
      "audioSha256": "e2de5c48daca812e3594cf74dffd966f4a28e2e82d3aa5a6475e7e27425521e5",
      "recognized": "有许多才智出众的基督徒思想家，对这些浩统所指的事情何时发生、如何发生，有着不同的解读。",
      "similarity": 0.948718,
