      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0002-u029",
      "targetTextSha256": "309b9a55a0d5c14b0978f82d947133422ab3f0565c3892e47bce6c4643cb9e3b",
      "audioSha256": "9e20b7885dbfa27999e3b6507fd646b37da448a62fcea1b5be73b76ff55f47d1",
      "recognized": "所以如果你想更深入地了解，想稍微钻研一下不同的末世观，可以收听《If I Had More Time》播客。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0002-u030",
      "targetTextSha256": "b68a8b39a9c59b094875b607b985dc1f914bab4ac032b869259a4dfd182d9645",
      "audioSha256": "50db2d0b548300ffdd9b418937f940c1c2a5b4216646db64ffd00acbe1d50a82",
      "recognized": "而且我们还真会深入钻研一番。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0002-u031",
      "targetTextSha256": "5f1137217ce766982f88d84a19486f304fa8a7eeccb80447245e9d8b2ce033b4",
      "audioSha256": "715af08e822388b9b609a63266526da59acf12a2eb0b77082811ddd9b8c85a85",
      "recognized": "但我想让大家知道的是，所有的学者。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0002-u032",
      "targetTextSha256": "2c6f4abd006c4c1a255f1b492e4afccb9d6928cd75df6e53345caf654fa5dc52",
      "audioSha256": "53a693be50efa8d9b4b7ffd58f829002eb9b7ac467da98382587eb723dc92cd5",
      "recognized": "这四种观点都一致认为，这些号角的警告是神向这个悖逆的世界发出的神圣警告。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
